docs/ideas/

# Claude's project instructions and session handoff: kept on this computer only (the repo is public)
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md

# Working files for building the project, kept on this computer only (the repo is public).
# Claude's plans, the discussion records with Claude (notes/claude_feedback/) and an early superseded query
# (notes/old/), except the format changes meant for the colleague. Everything needed to rebuild the data,
# Claude's categorizing steps included, is in rstar-pipeline/ and is shared.
notes/*
!notes/rstar-json-format-changes.md
# Claude's preview server settings:
.claude/launch.json
